-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-1-1\">One-Click VR Walkthrough</h3>\n<p class=\"text-white/80 max-w-md\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-1-2\">No more endless site visits. Walk through every room from your browser with studio-quality 360-degree precision.</p>\n<button class=\"mt-8 bg-white text-[var(--accent-orange)] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-heading font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-1-3\">Experience Now</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hidden md:block w-48 h-48 bg-white/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-2\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-rotate-360 text-white text-6xl\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-2-1\"></i>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-24 px-6 md:px-12 bg-[var(--bg-base)]\" data-kid=\"1-6\">\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\" data-kid=\"1-6-1\">\n<div class=\"relative h-[700px] w-full bg-black rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl reveal-up\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1\">\n<video autoplay=\"\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"vr demo preview video\" data-reason=\"video looped and autoplayed by browser\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\" src=\"https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/7614413/pexels-photo-7614413.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=1280&amp;q=80\"></video>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-6\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2\">\n<div class=\"w-20 h-20 glass rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-8 cursor-pointer hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-player-play-filled text-3xl translate-x-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1\"></i>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"font-heading text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-2\">Step inside your future.</h2>\n<p class=\"text-white/70 max-w-xl text-lg font-body mb-10\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-3\">High-fidelity 360° tours that accurately represent every inch of the property. No misleading wide-angle shots. Just pure transparency.</p>\n<button class=\"bg-white text-[var(--ink-primary)] px-12 py-4 rounded-full font-heading font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[var(--accent-orange)] hover:text-white transition-all duration-300\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-4\">Start Virtual Walkthrough</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-10 glass px-6 py-3 rounded-full flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-3\">\n<div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full animate-pulse\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"live indicator pulse dot\" data-reason=\"animation pulses continuously via CSS\"></div>\n<span class=\"text-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-3-2\">Live VR Simulation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-24 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto\" data-kid=\"1-7\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center\" data-kid=\"1-7-1\">\n<div class=\"reveal-up\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1\">\n<span class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[var(--accent-orange)] block mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1\">The AI Recommendation Engine</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-heading text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2\">Properties that fit<br data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-1\">your daily life.</h2>\n<p class=\"text-[var(--ink-secondary)] text-lg mb-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3\">We don't just match bedrooms and budgets. We match commute times, park proximity, nightlife vibes, and pet-friendly spaces.</p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4\">\n<button class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-gray-200 font-medium hover:border-[var(--accent-orange)] hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4-1\">Early Morning Runs</button>\n<button class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-[var(--accent-orange)] text-[var(--accent-orange)] font-medium shadow-sm bg-[var(--accent-o