\">₹10,000</span> when the deal completes. No login required. Total transparency.</p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-1-4\">\n<button class=\"bg-[var(--accent-orange)] text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-[20px] font-heading font-bold text-lg hover:scale-105 transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-1-4-1\">Start Referring Now</button>\n<button class=\"bg-white/10 text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-[20px] font-heading font-bold text-lg border border-white/20 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-1-4-2\">Learn More</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hidden lg:block relative\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-2\">\n<div class=\"w-96 h-96 border border-[var(--accent-orange)]/20 rounded-full absolute -top-20 -right-20 animate-pulse\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"referral graphic decoration\" data-reason=\"pulsing animation by CSS keyframes\"></div>\n<div class=\"w-64 h-64 border border-[var(--accent-orange)]/40 rounded-full absolute top-10 right-10\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"referral graphic decoration\"></div>\n<img class=\"w-64 h-64 mx-auto rotate-45\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"referral graphic icon\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/game-icons-transparent@latest/svgs/lorc/concentric-crescents.svg\" style=\"color: var(--accent-orange); opacity: 0.2;\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<footer class=\"py-24 bg-[var(--bg-base)] border-t border-gray-200\" data-kid=\"1-10\">\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-16 mb-24\" data-kid=\"1-10-1\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-10-1-1\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-1\">\n<div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-[var(--accent-orange)] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-1-1\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-home-2 text-white text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-1-1-1\"></i>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-heading text-xl font-bold tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-1-2\">360GHAR</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-[var(--ink-secondary)] text-sm mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-2\">India's first AI + VR property platform. We eliminate fake listings through studio-quality walkthroughs and professional verification.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-3\">\n<a class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:border-[var(--accent-orange)] hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-3-1\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-brand-twitter\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-3-1-1\"></i></a>\n<a class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:border-[var(--accent-orange)] hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-3-2\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-brand-instagram\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-3-2-1\"></i></a>\n<a class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:border-[var(--accent-orange)] hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-3-3\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-brand-linkedin\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-1-3-3-1\"></i></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-10-1-2\">\n<h4 class=\"font-heading font-bold mb-8 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest text-[var(--ink-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-1\">Company</h4>\n<ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2\">\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-1\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">About Us</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-2\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Careers</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-3\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">Verified Builders</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-4\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-4-1\" href=\"#\">Referral Program</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-5\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-2-2-5-1\" href=\"#\">Contact Support</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-10-1-3\">\n<h4 class=\"font-heading font-bold mb-8 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest text-[var(--ink-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-1\">Resources</h4>\n<ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2\">\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-1\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">AI Search Guide</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-2\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">VR Tour Tech</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-3\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">Price Trends Data</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-4\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-4-1\" href=\"#\">Legal Documentation</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-5\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-3-2-5-1\" href=\"#\">Sitemap</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-10-1-4\">\n<h4 class=\"font-heading font-bold mb-8 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest text-[var(--ink-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-4-1\">Newsletter</h4>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)] mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-4-2\">Get premium Gurugram property insights delivered to your inbox.</p>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-1.5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-4-3\">\n<input class=\"flex-1 bg-transparent border-none outline-hidden px-4 text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-4-3-1\" placeholder=\"Your email...\" type=\"email\">\n<button class=\"bg-[var(--accent-orange)] text-white p-3 rounded-xl hover:scale-105 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-4-3-2\"><i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-10-1-4-3-2-1\"></i></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 border-t border-gray-200 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-10-2\">\n<div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--ink-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-2-1\">© 2026 360Ghar Real Estate • Gurugram, India</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-8 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--ink-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-2-2\">\n<a class=\"hover:text-[var(--ink-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Privacy Policy</a>\n<a class=\"hover:text-[var(--ink-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-2-2-2\" href=\"#\">Terms of Service</a>\n<a class=\"hover:text-[var(--ink-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-10-2-2-3\" href=\"#\">Cookie Policy</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\" data-kid=\"2\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\" data-kid=\"3\"></script>\n<script data-kid=\"4\">\n  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n  // Initial reveal animations\n  gsap.from('.reveal-up', {\n    opacity: 0,\n    y: 60,\n    duration: 1.2,\n    stagger: 0.1,\n    ease: 'power4.out',\n    scrollTrigger: {\n      trigger: '.reveal-up',\n      start: 'top 85%',\n    }\n  });\n\n  // Section-wise reveals\n  document.querySelectorAll('section').forEach(section => {\n    gsap.from(section.querySelectorAll('.reveal-up'), {\n      opacity: 0,\n      y: 40,\n      duration: 1,\n      stagger: 0.15,\n      ease: 'power3.out',\n      scrollTrigger: {\n        trigger: section,\n        start: 'top 80%',\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  // Hero Stats Float Offset\n  gsap.to('.animate-float', {\n    y: -20,\n    duration: 3,\n    repeat: -1,\n    yoyo: true,\n    ease: 'sine.inOut'\n  });\n</script>",
