lass=\"font-bold mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-1-2-1\">Instant Inventory Access</h4>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-(--ink-secondary)\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-1-2-2\">Get direct access to 5,000+ builder-direct verified inventories in one click.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-2\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-soft flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-(--border-default)\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-2-1\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-id text-(--accent-orange) text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-2-1-1\"></i>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-2-2\">\n<h4 class=\"font-bold mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-2-2-1\">CRM for Real Estate Experts</h4>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-(--ink-secondary)\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3-2-2-2\">Manage your clients, site visits, and payouts on India's most advanced brokerage dashboard.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<button class=\"bg-(--ink-primary) text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold shadow-xl hover:bg-black transition-all flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-4\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-4-1\">Join as Partner Broker</span>\n<i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-4-2\"></i>\n</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-24 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto\" data-kid=\"1-7\">\n<div class=\"text-center mb-16\" data-kid=\"1-7-1\">\n<h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4 tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1\">Trusted by Home Seekers in Gurugram</h2>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-1 text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-1\"></i><i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-2\"></i><i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-3\"></i><i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-4\"></i><i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1-5\"></i>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2\">(4.9/5 based on 12,000+ deals)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-7-2\">\n<div class=\"bg-white p-10 rounded-(--radius-xl) shadow-soft border border-(--border-default) relative overflow-hidden group\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-quote absolute -top-4 -right-4 text-[120px] text-(--bg-base) group-hover:text-(--accent-orange)/5 transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-1\"></i>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-2\">\n<img alt=\"Rahul\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-white shadow-md\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-2-1\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?u=rahul\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-2-2\">\n<div class=\"font-bold text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-2-2-1\">Rahul S.</div>\n<div class=\"text-[10px] text-(--ink-secondary) font-bold uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-2-2-2\">Bought in Sector 65</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold leading-relaxed relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-1-3\">\"The VR tours saved me at least 10 physical visits. I shortlisted my 3BHK from home and only visited the one I finally bought. True transparency.\"</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-10 rounded-(--radius-xl) shadow-soft border border-(--border-default) relative overflow-hidden group\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-quote absolute -top-4 -right-4 text-[120px] text-(--bg-base) group-hover:text-(--accent-orange)/5 transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-1\"></i>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-2\">\n<img alt=\"Priya\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-white shadow-md\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-2-1\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?u=priya\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-2-2\">\n<div class=\"font-bold text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-2-2-1\">Priya M.</div>\n<div class=\"text-[10px] text-(--ink-secondary) font-bold uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-2-2-2\">Tenant in DLF Phase 3</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold leading-relaxed relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-2-3\">\"Moving from Delhi was stressful, but 360Ghar made it painless. The RERA verification and builder pills gave me instant peace of mind.\"</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-10 rounded-(--radius-xl) shadow-soft border border-(--border-default) relative overflow-hidden group\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-quote absolute -top-4 -right-4 text-[120px] text-(--bg-base) group-hover:text-(--accent-orange)/5 transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3-1\"></i>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3-2\">\n<img alt=\"Amit\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-white shadow-md\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3-2-1\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?u=amit\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-7-2-3-2-2\">\n<div class=\"font-bold text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3-2-2-1\">Amit K.</div>\n<div class=\"text-[10px] text-(--ink-secondary) font-bold uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3-2-2-2\">Investor</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold leading-relaxed relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-2-3-3\">\"Their price trend charts are an investor's best friend. I've bought two properties through them and both have appreciated significantly.\"</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-24 px-4 bg-(--charcoal) overflow-hidden relative\" data-kid=\"1-8\">\n<div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10\" data-kid=\"1-8-1\">\n<div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-(--accent-orange) rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white mx-auto mb-8 shadow-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-gift text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1-1\"></i>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-2\">Know Someone Selling or Renting?</h2>\n<p class=\"text-white/60 text-lg mb-12 max-w-xl mx-auto\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-3\">Refer a property owner and earn up to <span class=\"text-white font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-3-1\">₹10,000</span> when the deal completes. No login required!</p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4\">\n<button class=\"w-full md:w-auto bg-(--accent-orange) text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-full font-bold text-lg shadow-xl hover:brightness-110 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-1\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-send\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-1-1\"></i>\n<span data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-1-2\">Start Referring Now</span>\n</button>\n<div class=\"text-white/40 text-xs font-medium border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l border-white/10 pt-4 md:pt-0 md:pl-6\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-2\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-info-circle mr-1\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-2-1\"></i> Open to all. No account needed.\n        </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<img class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none\" data-kid=\"1-8-2\" data-name=\"decorative circle mesh\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/game-icons-transparent@latest/svgs/lorc/concentric-crescents.svg\" style=\"filter: invert(1);\">\n</section>\n\n<footer class=\"py-24 px-4 bg-white border-t border-(--border-default)\" data-kid=\"1-9\">\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16\" data-kid=\"1-9-1\">\n<div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-1\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-1\">\n<div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-(--accent-orange) rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-1-1\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-home-2 text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-1-1-1\"></i>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-display font-bold text-xl tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-1-2\">360GHAR</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-(--ink-secondary) leading-relaxed mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-2\">India's only VR-First PropTech platform, headquartered in Gurugram. We eliminate fake listings with 100% verification.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-3\">\n<a class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-(--bg-base) flex items-center justify-center text-(--ink-primary) hover:bg-(--accent-orange) hover:text-white transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-3-1\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-brand-twitter\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-3-1-1\"></i></a>\n<a class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-(--bg-base) flex items-center justify-center text-(--ink-primary) hover:bg-(--accent-orange) hover:text-white transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-3-2\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-brand-instagram\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-3-2-1\"></i></a>\n<a class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-(--bg-base) flex items-center justify-center text-(--ink-primary) hover:bg-(--accent-orange) hover:text-white transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-3-3\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-brand-linkedin\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-1-3-3-1\"></i></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-9-1-2\">\n<h4 class=\"font-display font-bold mb-6 text-(--ink-primary)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-1\">Top Localities</h4>\n<ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm text-(--ink-secondary) font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2\">\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-1\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">Sector 54, Gurgaon</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-2\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Golf Course Road</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-3\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">DLF Phase 5</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-4\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-4-1\" href=\"#\">Sohna Road</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-5\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-2-2-5-1\" href=\"#\">Cyber Hub Area</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-9-1-3\">\n<h4 class=\"font-display font-bold mb-6 text-(--ink-primary)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-1\">Company</h4>\n<ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm text-(--ink-secondary) font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2\">\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-1\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">About Us</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-2\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Join as Broker</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-3\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">Partner Builders</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-4\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-4-1\" href=\"#\">Real Estate Tools</a></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-5\"><a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-3-2-5-1\" href=\"#\">Contact Support</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-9-1-4\">\n<h4 class=\"font-display font-bold mb-6 text-(--ink-primary)\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-4-1\">Subscribe to Alerts</h4>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-1 bg-(--bg-base) rounded-full border border-(--border-default) mb-4 focus-within:border-(--accent-orange) transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-4-2\">\n<input class=\"bg-transparent flex-1 px-4 py-2 text-sm outline-none\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-4-2-1\" placeholder=\"Your Email\" type=\"email\">\n<button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-(--accent-orange) text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-4-2-2\"><i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-4-2-2-1\"></i></button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-[10px] text-(--ink-secondary) font-medium px-4\" data-kid=\"1-9-1-4-3\">Get the latest Gurugram listings directly in your inbox.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-8 border-t border-(--border-default) flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-9-2\">\n<div class=\"text-xs text-(--ink-secondary) font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-1\">© 2026 360Ghar. All Rights Reserved. RERA Reg No: GGM/2023/102</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-8 text-xs text-(--ink-secondary) font-medium uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2\">\n<a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Privacy Policy</a>\n<a class=\"hover:text-(--accent-orange)\" data-kid=\"1-9-2-2-2\" href=\"#\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n\n<a class=\"fixed bottom-8 right-8 z-50 group\" data-kid=\"1-10\" data-name=\"whatsapp floating widget\" href=\"#\">\n<div class=\"absolute -top-12 right-0 bg-white shadow-xl px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-(--ink-primary) opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity border border-(--border-default) pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap\" data-kid=\"1-10-1\" data-name=\"whatsapp tooltip\">\n      Chat with RM on WhatsApp\n    </div>\n<div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-(--whatsapp) text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgba(37,211,102,0.4)] hover:scale-110 transition-transform active:scale-95\" data-kid=\"1-10-2\" data-name=\"whatsapp floating icon container\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-brand-whatsapp text-4xl\" data-kid=\"1-10-2-1\" data-name=\"whatsapp icon\"></i>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>",
